---
import Container from "../ui/Container.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../ui/SectionHeading.astro";
import StoryVisual from "../ui/StoryVisual.astro";

---

<section id="story" class="bg-background py-14 sm:py-20">
  <Container>
    <SectionHeading badge="Our Story" title="Why Grovera Exists" />

    <div class="mt-16 grid items-center gap-20 lg:grid-cols-2">

      <!-- LEFT -->

      <div class="space-y-8 text-lg leading-8 text-text-muted">

        <p>
          Grovera was not built because the world needed another marketing
          agency. It was built because we believed businesses deserved another
          way to grow.
        </p>

        <p>
          While working in the marketing industry, we saw businesses feeling
          pressured to follow approaches that did not always align with their
          values. We believed there was a better way — a way where success did
          not require compromise.
        </p>

        <p>
          That belief became Grovera: a Shariah-compliant marketing agency that
          brings together strategy, creativity, and professionalism while
          remaining rooted in Islamic values.
        </p>

        <p class="font-medium text-text">
          Because to us, success is not only about achieving results.
          It is about achieving them the right way.
        </p>

      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT -->

      <StoryVisual />

    </div>
  </Container>
</section>